      "text": "5 1. Contact 1.1. Contact organization General Authority for Statistics 1.2. Contact organization unit Environment, Agriculture and Energy Statistics Department 1.3. Contact person function Director of Environment, Agriculture and Energy Statistics Department 1.4. Contact mail address P.O. Box: 3735 Riyadh, 11481 Kingdom of Saudi Arabia 1.5. Contact email address info@stats.gov.sa 1.6. Contact phone number 199009 2. Methodology and Quality Update 2.1. Methodology and Quality last update 30/12/2024 3. Statistical Presentation 3.1. Data description The water accounts present data on the environmental and economic aspects of water in Saudi Arabia. Water Accounts is a statistical product whose data is collected mainly through administrative records data on the main characteristics as follows:",
